        "answerEq": "100 ÷ [ 1 + (x ÷ 0.21) ] [vol%] | LFL / 0.55 × Cst , UFL / 3.5 × Cst / 에테인(C2H6, x = 3.5몰) / LFL = 0.55 × 5.66 ≈ 3.1%",
