        "promptHtml": "<div class=\"subj-eq-line\">(100 ÷ Lm) = <span class=\"subj-blank\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" onclick=\"HarnessEngine.toggleSubjBlank(this)\" data-ans=\"(V1 ÷ L1) + (V2 ÷ L2) + (V3 ÷ L3) [단, V1 + V2 + V3\"><span class=\"subj-ph\">[ 빈칸 1 · 정답 확인 ]</span><span class=\"subj-ans\">(V1 ÷ L1) + (V2 ÷ L2) + (V3 ÷ L3) [단, V1 + V2 + V3</span></span> = <span class=\"subj-blank\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" onclick=\"HarnessEngine.toggleSubjBlank(this)\" data-ans=\"100 vol%]\"><span class=\"subj-ph\">[ 빈칸 2 · 정답 확인 ]</span><span class=\"subj-ans\">100 vol%]</span></span></div><div class=\"subj-ex-line\">💡 <strong>예제 풀이</strong> | 혼합가스 체적비가 V<sub>A</sub> 20%(L<sub>A</sub> 4%), V<sub>B</sub> 40%(L<sub>B</sub> 20%), V<sub>C</sub> 40%(L<sub>C</sub> 10%)일 때 ➔ 100 &divide; L<sub>m</sub> = (20 &divide; 4) + (40 &divide; 20) + (40 &divide; 10) = 5 + 2 + 4 = 11 &nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp; L<sub>m</sub> = 100 &divide; 11 &approx; <span class=\"subj-blank\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" onclick=\"HarnessEngine.toggleSubjBlank(this)\" data-ans=\"약 9.1%\"><span class=\"subj-ph\">[ 빈칸 3 · 정답 확인 ]</span><span class=\"subj-ans\">약 9.1%</span></span></div>",
        "answerEq": "(V1 ÷ L1) + (V2 ÷ L2) + (V3 ÷ L3) [단, V1 + V2 + V3 / 100 vol%] / 약 9.1%",
        "fullFormula": "(100 ÷ Lm) = (V1 ÷ L1) + (V2 ÷ L2) + (V3 ÷ L3) [단, V1 + V2 + V3 = 100 vol%]",
        "explanation": "💡 예제 풀이 | 혼합가스 체적비가 VA 20%(LA 4%), VB 40%(LB 20%), VC 40%(LC 10%)일 때 ➔ 100 ÷ Lm = (20 ÷ 4) + (40 ÷ 20) + (40 ÷ 10) = 5 + 2 + 4 = 11 ⇒ Lm = 100 ÷ 11 ≈ 약 9.1%"
